---
/** Pinned statement; words light up as you scroll through the pin. */
---

<section class="v2-manifesto" data-theme="light" id="why">
  <div class="v2-manifesto__pin">
    <div class="v2-manifesto__meta">
      <span class="v2-eyebrow">Why we exist</span>
      <span class="v2-mono" style="color: var(--muted)">(01)</span>
    </div>
    <p class="v2-manifesto__text" data-words>
      Hospitality is a human business. The admin isn't. We hand the busywork to machines,
      <em>so your people can get back to people.</em>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
